        "title": "Configuring Backup storage for Ovirt",
        "short_description": "The project is about configuring any Data Storage Domain as a new Backup Storage Domain.\n\nAfter setting the storage domain to use for backup, all...",
        "description": "<h3>The project is about configuring any Data Storage Domain as a new Backup Storage Domain.</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>After setting the storage domain to use for backup, all other storage domain can store their VMs, Templates and disks into it.</li>\n<li>This feature can be used through REST request or by GUI checkbox available while creating or importing any data storage domain.</li>\n<li>It is an another step in deprecating the export domain which have few limitations.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "student_name": "Shubham Dubey",
        "code_url": "https://github.com/shubham0d/Gsoc-2017-ovirt/blob/master/GsocFinalReport/FinalReport.md",
        "project_url": "https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2017/projects/6180741675220992/"
